pixie mage watcher~
a pixie watcher~
This serious pixie is watching the city for trouble.
~
This pixie is a bit older than the others and does not have the same playful
manner.  They float about, watching for signs of any trouble, either from
rebels or the half-orc servants.  They do not carry any weapons but judging by
the look in their eyes they have some tricks up their sleeves.
~
